<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibid> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "International Business Identifier (IBID) <https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/> is a verifiable unique identifier for legal entities as defined in the ISO/DIS 25500-3 <https://www.iso.org/standard/87705.html> draft standard. It is composed of three data elements: the International Business Registration Number (IBRN), the legal name, and the date of origin formatted as eight numeric characters (YYYYMMDD). Each element is separated by a pipe character (|) (e.g., US-DE.BER:3031657|Code Management Association|19990420)."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Build/configSourceDigest> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Property that describes the digest of the build configuration file used to\ninvoke a build."@en .
